  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The BODMAS rule is given as follows:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/82c3e40a02b8c826e0d868ad0661efd9dcbce5afdb4d9591a54019ab40c8b055.png] \n\nGiven equation: 8 × 9 ÷ 4 + 5 - 3 = 2.\n\nNow, we check the options and see which one follows:\n\nOption 1) 8 and 4\n\n→ 8 × 9 ÷ 4 + 5 - 3 = 2\n\n→ 4 × __**9 ÷ 8**__ + 5 - 3 = 2\n\n→ __**4**____** × 1.125**__ + 5 - 3 = 2\n\n→ __**4.5 + 5**__ -3 = 2\n\n→ __**9.5 - 3**__ = 2\n\n→ 6.5 ≠ 2\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 2 and 5\n\n→ 8 × 9 ÷ 4 + 5 - 3 = 2\n\n→ 8 × __**9 ÷ 4**__ + 2 - 3 = 5\n\n→ __**8 × 2.25**__ + 2 - 3 = 5\n\n→ __**18 + 2**__ - 3 = 5\n\n→ __**20 - 3**__ = 5\n\n→ 17 ≠ 5\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 3 and 9\n\n→ 8 × 9 ÷ 4 + 5 - 3 = 2\n\n→ 8 × __**3 ÷ 4**__ + 5 - 9 = 2\n\n→ __**8 × 0.75**__ + 5 - 9 = 2\n\n→ __**6 + 5**__ - 9 = 2\n\n→ __**11 - 9**__ = 2\n\n→ 2 = 2\n\n→ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) 9 and 2\n\n→ 8 × 9 ÷ 4 + 5 - 3 = 2\n\n→ 8 × __**2 ÷ 4**__ + 5 - 3 = 9\n\n→ __**8 × 0.5**__ + 5 - 3 = 9\n\n→ __**4 + 5**__ - 3 = 9\n\n→ 9 - 3 = 9\n\n→ 6 ≠ 9\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
